ply A-FDT as the essay interprets it.","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'm weighing whether, under A-FDT, intervening on my own observation's node would also move the other copy's node, given they see different inputs. Strictly, the other copy's node is a separate one held at its prior, but the essay's section 6.2 on partial similarity may suggest treating them as partly linked.\n\nUnder strict A-FDT the other copy's node stays at its prior, and since sending dominates for any prior q, the fixed point is both sending. The essay's partial-similarity idea in 6.2 could link the two nodes as a noisy edge, but that was built for different algorithms, while here it's the same algorithm on a different input, which 6.3 handles by holding the other node fixed. So I'll go with sending.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether, under A-FDT, intervening on my own observation's node would also move the other copy's node, given they see different inputs. Strictly, the other copy's node is a separate one held at its prior, but the essay's section 6.2 on partial similarity may suggest treating them as partly linked.\n\nUnder strict A-FDT the other copy's node stays at its prior, and since sending dominates for any prior q, the fixed point is both sending. The essay's partial-similarity idea in 6.2 could link the two nodes as a noisy edge, but that was built for different algorithms, while here it's the same algorithm on a different input, which 6.3 handles by holding the other node fixed. So I'll go with sending.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10268,"completion_tokens":1230,"total_tokens":11498,"cost":0.065672,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.065672,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.041072,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0246},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":625,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}